1. $f(0) = 0$
2. $f(xy) = f(x)f(y)$ for all $x, y \in R$ (multiplicativity)
3. $f(x) \geq 0$ for all $x \in R$ (non-negativity)
4. $f(x + y) \leq f(x) + f(y)$ for all $x, y \in R$ (subadditivity)
5. $f(-x) = f(x)$ for all $x \in R$ (evenness)
