Name: Num.mem_ofZNum'
Description: For any nonnegative binary integer $m$ (of type `Num`) and any signed binary integer $n$ (of type `ZNum`), $m$ is in the result of converting $n$ to an optional nonnegative binary integer (via `ofZNum'`) if and only if $n$ equals the conversion of $m$ to a signed binary integer (via `toZNum`). In other words:
$$ m \in \text{ofZNum'}(n) \leftrightarrow n = \text{toZNum}(m) $$
